<p>Creates a temporal storm for <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> to <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">2, 2, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns that deals between <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">3.33, 6.18, 10, 14, 17</acronym> and <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>spellpower 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>paradox 300">10, 19, 30, 41, 50</acronym> temporal damage each turn.</p>